From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:14:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Case 7 SolidWorks script: links checked before they drive
 a dimension; bevels constrained

A dimension is linked to its global variable only when the two agree; otherwise
the link is reported and left out (an equation had moved the geometry by
-213 mm^3 in SolidWorks). Each bevel end lies on a construction line from its
joint, normal to its member's centerline (the base sketch was under defined).
Stand-in: Parameter reads sketch dimensions back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BdLZZ8R4FqXDzDRWDvVnZQ
